Even though all features are included, build in order.

Best priority order:

1. Foundation and auth
2. Public website and pricing
3. Checkout and onboarding
4. Level checks
5. Approval and account creation
6. Lesson credits and booking
7. Student/parent portals
8. Homework/scenarios/reviews
9. Progress, flashcards, badges
10. AI tools
